                "text": "Lifestyle changes are key to prevention. We need to:\n\n\ud83c\udf6c Combat obesity, which affects ~42% of U.S. adults\n\ud83e\udd66 Make it easier to follow a healthy diet and promote \u201cfood as medicine\u201d\n\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Encourage exercise, such as through @MikeKellyPA\u2019s PHIT Act",
